# Stackra file contract:
# Purpose: map the two Stackra npm scopes to the Stackra registry, so `pnpm install` resolves @stackra/* (free, no
#          token) and @stackra-pro/* (licensed) there, and a package this repository publishes under them goes there.
# Boundary: scope mappings only; no value. A Pro install adds the licence token line from the README (a reference
#           to STACKRA_LICENCE_TOKEN, never the token). Never npmjs, never Keygen (ADR 0453).
# Runtime: node
# Governing contract: Stackra ADR 0453 (decision 10); ADR 0461 (the Pro line).
@stackra:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
@stackra-pro:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
